hey also help in better understanding  of the mechanism of interest  ilynx is host to many  pathway analysis tools  which uh  sorry with many of their redirect  redirecting links attached with them  panther databases provide us with its  own  benefits of graphical representation of  functional pathways along with their  evolutionary analysis  now let's move to the pictorial  representation  this slide shows the series matrix data  that we downloaded  along with the group data  this is the group data after grouping  this is how it looked with  red representing ir green representing  mock data and  this blue color representing  uv data  this picture shows the david  david result  page of jail list which was obtained by  submitting the probe ids of the data set  using r the gene ids were merged with  the probe ids and  are presented in this picture  t bio platform is a  cloud-based uh package of big data  analysis big data analysis application  it offers numerous amount of numerous  pipelines to run our data and get the  analysis done  it also gives the user an option to go  through the demo pipelines  for for better understanding of the  functionality of platform  here pca results are shown before  grouping was done it was done to get an  idea about the distribution of the  samples  expression before grouping as well  after grouping three pc were run  they were mock versus  ir and uv  mark versus uv  and mock versus ir  both the pc's  in both the pcs nothing much of  significance was found  the samples were forming a scattered  carpet of plot  thus coming to a conclusion was  difficult  so we moved to the pathway analysis  this picture shows us the ilink's  homepage with various features  ready to be explored  this is the signature submission page  where we submit our signature and this  signature includes the gene ids the full  change value and p value as optional  category  after hitting submit  signature this output is recorded this  shows the signature analysis tools  which  we can perform  and get the information about pathways  networks or  general visualization of the genes  for this presentation i have included  the example of enricher  once the data is submitted on enricher  this is the page that opens up in front  of us with our gene results  here also we have different pi uh  pathways available for us to explore  i have opened king 2021 human  bar graph  this shows the expression level was a  high  cell cycle followed by other pathways  we can also use the cluster gram view to  view the  genes versus the pathway graph  it shows the genes here and the  expression level of various pathways  panther db  this is the uh  page where we submit the gene uh gene  list for gene list analysis these list  is submitted by a comma separated  file  and we select the require the  options from here like homo sapiens and  select the analysis  we want if you want a view if you want  to view the gene list this is the result  that is shown and for graph  we select the graph option to have a  graphical chart representation this is a  graphical chart representation of  panther db pathway  this is the pathway between ir and mock  and there are many peaks in it  which we'll discuss further  this is the uv versus mock  functional classification in barcha  and these are the color codings of  various pathways  results now in results uh we have many  top prop sets  uh  from out of those prop sets  the majorly that were explored were  stress response  cell cycle  proliferation cell structure signal  transduction apoptosis energy metabolism  and few other were there  the down regulated pathways showed more  expression in contrast to the  upregulated pathways  while going through the uv responsive  genes it was observed that around 59  percent of the genes were miscellaneous  as there was not much information that  was explored about their role  in  radiational effects on the skin  nonetheless  significant number of genes were  selected which has the relevance to the  query pathways  ir and uv genes showed similar  distribution  in functional pathway  from these results we interpreted that  if there is an uh  due to the exposure to the radiation to  the cell lines there will abrupt  activities  of cell line of sorry of cell cycle and  energy metabolism  that caused  skin lesions  and  which may further lead to carcinoma  development  above  tortic cycles showed an increased  expression  which may be inferred as  a way in which the cells  the components are  aiding in prevention of further  proliferation of the abnormal cells or  there is a breakdown of essential  cellular components  the outcome  proposed that protein translation is  additionally hindered by  halted transcription of trna synthetase  genes  these were the references  this was the paper from which the  datasets main analysis was done  and followed by some other  references  at last  but not the least i would like to thank  my mentors and pine biotech faculties  for helping me in my fellowship have a  great day ahead
 

